{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18603","headline":"朗州窦常员外寄刘二十八诗见促行骑走笔酬赠 · 柳宗元","name":"朗州窦常员外寄刘二十八诗见促行骑走笔酬赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"投荒垂一纪，新诏下荆扉。\n疑比庄周梦，情如苏武归。\n赐环留逸响，五马助征騑。\n不羡衡阳雁，春来前後飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}